{"id":"1e1e4ef852dd39f8","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-filter7-cauchy-filter.md","title":"ZFC Filter7 Cauchy Filter","display":"df-zfc-filter7-cauchy-filter — ZFC Filter7 Cauchy Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter7-cauchy-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter7-cauchy-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-filter7-cauchy-filter — ZFC Filter7 Cauchy Filter","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-analysis2-uniform-space]]","[[58-df-filter-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter7-cauchy-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter7-cauchy-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter7-cauchy-filter — ZFC Filter7 Cauchy Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"62ea7cd84f64e253\" href=\"?note=62ea7cd84f64e253\" title=\"58-df-zfc-analysis2-uniform-space\">58-df-zfc-analysis2-uniform-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"58-df-filter-set\">58-df-filter-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal F\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal F\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2UniformSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2UniformSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal E)\\)</span> (uniform-space predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"62ea7cd84f64e253\" href=\"?note=62ea7cd84f64e253\" title=\"58-df-zfc-analysis2-uniform-space\">58-df-zfc-analysis2-uniform-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\)</span> (proper filter-on-a-set predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"58-df-filter-set\">58-df-filter-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> ranges over the entourages in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7CauchyFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7CauchyFilter}_S\\)</span> is the predicate defined here</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}cauchy\\text{-}filter}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7CauchyFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2UniformSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal E\\;\\exists F\\in\\mathcal F\\;(F\\times F\\subseteq E)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}cauchy\\text{-}filter}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7CauchyFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2UniformSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal E\\;\\exists F\\in\\mathcal F\\;(F\\times F\\subseteq E)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical set-filter predicate is proper.  The former order-filter encoding admitted <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>, whose empty member made the Cauchy clause vacuous.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-uniform-space","status":"resolved","id":"62ea7cd84f64e253","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-analysis2-uniform-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter-set","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-filter-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-uniform-space","status":"resolved","id":"62ea7cd84f64e253","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2UniformSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal E)$ (uniform-space predicate; see [[58-df-zfc-analysis2-uniform-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter-set","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filter}_S$ (proper filter-on-a-set predicate; see [[58-df-filter-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2UniformSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7CauchyFilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}cauchy\\text{-}filter}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7CauchyFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2UniformSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal E\\;\\exists F\\in\\mathcal F\\;(F\\times F\\subseteq E)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(X)","display":false}],"bytes":1231,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1911","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-filter7-cauchy-filter.md|58-df-zfc-filter7-cauchy-filter]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["62ea7cd84f64e253","5a7d94a7a7f8209a"]}